# The pictures of shell.md: a rectangle extruded, its top face picked
# and the block hollowed open there; the thickness changed; then a side
# face taken away as well, through [change] beside the faces; last,
# the pot example. Coordinates are those of the 600x600 headless
# window.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
# The top face is picked in the view from above.
cursor on
click-face top face of g003-extrude
shot shell-1-face gw
menu Features|Shell Solid
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
cursor off
shot shell-2-hollowed
cursor on
twmove 200 125
mark 28 122 217 22 tw
shot shell-3-thickness-link tw
twdown L 200 125
twup L 200 125
edit 4
cursor off
shot shell-4-thickness-4
# [change] beside the faces, with nothing selected, makes the extrusion
# active and says what to pick (a message box, answered here).
answer ok
twmove 210 145
twdown L 210 145
twup L 210 145
# Fitted before anything is picked: Zoom To Fit fits the selection.
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
cursor on
click-face top face of g003-extrude
click-face side face of g003-extrude from r005-line-segment
mark 28 142 345 22 tw
shot shell-5-two-faces
twmove 210 145
twdown L 210 145
twup L 210 145
# The extrusion is still active: make the shell active again.
twmove 320 75
twdown L 320 75
twup L 320 75
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
cursor off
shot shell-6-open-twice
# The pot example, in a new file: rounded corners and a drain hole.
answer no
menu File|New
file $repo/examples/scripts/pot/pot.go
menu Script|Run File...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
shot shell-7-pot gw
